Rules:
- Add or update focused tests for behavior changes.
- Prefer deterministic fixtures and mocked external services.
- Cover the most important scopes first:
  - server routes, middleware, services, and model validation
  - client pages, reusable components, and state stores
  - AI fallback behavior, parsing failures, and safety checks
  - critical integration paths when a unit test would miss the bug
- Report which validation commands ran.
